@startuml
title D19 - Sequence tìm kiếm và gửi Offer (as-built)
autonumber

actor Buyer
participant "React SPA" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Material Service" as Material
participant "Company Service" as Company
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
queue NATS
database "material_db" as MaterialDB
database "company_db" as CompanyDB
database "order_db" as OrderDB
database "notif_db" as NotifDB

Buyer -> Web : Nhập từ khóa/bộ lọc
Web -> Gateway : GET /api/listings?... (public)
Gateway -> Material : ListListings(ctx)
Material -> MaterialDB : SELECT active listings
MaterialDB --> Material : SupplyListing[]
Material --> Gateway : danh sách
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200

Buyer -> Web : Chọn listing và nhập Offer
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/offers + bearer token
Gateway -> Company : GetCompanyByOwner(gRPC)
Company -> CompanyDB : SELECT Company theo buyer_id
CompanyDB --> Company : verified
Company --> Gateway : verified
Gateway -> Order : CreateOffer(gRPC)
Order -> OrderDB : INSERT Offer(status=pending)
Order -> OrderDB : INSERT Escrow(holding,\ntransaction_id=NULL)
Order -> NATS : publish cme.orders.offer.created
Order --> Gateway : Offer(pending)
par Event bất đồng bộ
NATS -> Notification : consume event
Notification -> NotifDB : INSERT Notification
else Đường đồng bộ giữ phản hồi UI
Gateway -> Notification : CreateNotification(gRPC,\nsame reference_id)
Notification -> NotifDB : INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
end
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200
Web --> Buyer : Hiển thị bill/Offer đã gửi

note over Order,OrderDB
  Escrow là ledger prototype, không có payment gateway.
  Ownership/kiểm tra Listing còn cần hoàn thiện.
end note
@enduml
